This file marks the standalone exhibition branch (feature/online-exhibition).

Its presence in a pull request's merge result makes the "Guard main" workflow
fail, so a branch cut from this one cannot be merged into main by accident.
Never copy or keep this file on main.

To make the guard enforceable, add a branch protection rule (or ruleset) for
`main` in the GitHub repository settings and require the status check
"block-exhibition-branch" (from the "Guard main" workflow) to pass before merging.
